{
  "title": { "zh": "反过来证" },
  "tray": "machine",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "auto 逐条套用规则，目标一大就搜不动了。<wiki-ref to=\"automation\"></wiki-ref>走另一条路：要证 C，先假设 ¬C，再在已知里找矛盾。Isabelle 的 Sledgehammer 就把目标交给这样的证明器。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "au-negate",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "becomes",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "目标" } }],
      "backtrack": true,
      "tests": [
        { "goal": "Wet", "hyps": ["Rain → Wet", "Rain"], "becomes": [["Rain → Wet; Rain; ¬Wet ⊢ ⊥"]] },
        { "goal": "Rain ∨ ¬Rain", "becomes": [["¬(Rain ∨ ¬Rain) ⊢ ⊥"]] },
        {
          "goal": "Bus → OnTime",
          "hyps": ["Bus → Up", "Up → OnTime"],
          "becomes": [["Bus → Up; Up → OnTime; ¬(Bus → OnTime) ⊢ ⊥"]]
        }
      ],
      "brief": {
        "zh": "设计一个证明助手：每个目标都变成 ⊥，要证的那句的否定放进已知。"
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "<part-ref to=\"part:raa\"></part-ref>把要证的 C 变成 ¬¬C，也就是 ¬C → ⊥。"
        }
      ],
      "solution": ["c0r0 = raa()", "c1r0 = impI()", "c0 = rule(in, c0r0)", "c1 = rule(c0, c1r0)", "out <- c1"],
      "naive": ["c0r0 = raa()", "c0 = rule(in, c0r0)", "out <- c0"]
    }
  ]
}
